Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了隨便你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我對小泉什麼感覺都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實 我會魔法哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的魔法 會讓小泉同學得到幸福哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有話在先啊 小泉喜歡的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才不會喜歡你這樣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的 這次真的不再喜歡大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這次真的 要回到過去的關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛的鐵拳！收下吧 少女之魂！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狀態絕佳！看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不會輸給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儘管放馬過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喲喲喲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你現在不給MAITY加油了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老師確實很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是大谷憑著弱小的身體還那麼努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表揚一下也未嘗不可啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟大谷現在到底是怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣…也沒什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼都沒發生 恢復到過去的關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相聲二人組復活啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,復活？真的？你們怎麼又回去了？？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼不好啊 結果還是那種關係感覺最好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你明白自己現在的處境嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷他啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉部長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,部長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY要…要解散了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…啊…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好過分 MAITY老師居然已經有未婚妻了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本來也沒打算瞞你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看來是從誰那裡聽說了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很沮喪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學好像一點也不沮喪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…啊…那個…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY你聽聽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎說她和大谷又恢復到相聲二人組的關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說說她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學居然是個膽小鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 總之 大谷能恢復狀態真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法還沒有解開哦 小泉同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合 集合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扭傷已經痊癒了 現在狀態絕佳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.49,0:05:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,籃球部的3年級社員引退賽日益臨近
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓他更是賣力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有話在先啊 小泉喜歡的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才不會喜歡你這樣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫非是…吃醋？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等..等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不要抱有無望的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到過去 回到過去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這以後你要怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你擋路了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也用不著打我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是是是 對不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 真是對不起了 我的腿太長了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要揍你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎真的要回到過去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 籃球部的比賽是週六舉行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙還真閒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有什麼不好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 我做那個帶過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是籃球經理經常帶的那個很可愛的東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醬油醃檸檬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種東西能吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道錯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醋醃檸檬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要酸死的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要來了 你還是不要來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難得想去給你加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃了那種怪東西 原本能打好的都打不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大不了我做給MAITY老師吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 明天顧問就復出了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙已經派不上用場了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活該
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是…吃醋？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛自己一個人在那搖頭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你當你是狗嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很痛耶…真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 檸檬用蜂蜜醃就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈 這樣啊 用蜂蜜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊是啊 要用蜂蜜哦 不要搞措了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到過去 回到過去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜂蜜醃檸檬是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又甜又酸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有時間說相聲二人組復活的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不如趕緊湊在一塊算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,確實是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再來就看大谷會不會採取行動了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:08:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最後的關鍵還是掌握在大谷手上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的 你去說說他啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 這時候應該要讓兩個年輕人自己來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是交給她們倆 就算等到老太婆也還是老樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說得是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他推倒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把大谷推倒 馬上把他占為己有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然就由我上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你們 真是皇帝不急 急死太監
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要在一起就趕緊在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也太亂來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪有你說得這麼簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然簡單了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經沒關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經不抱任何期望了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不抱期望？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你也不可能完全放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（猜中心事）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你該不會是想 等大谷來告白之前什麼都不做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要等那種人有所行動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在游泳池釣魚有什麼兩樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 可是 裡面搞不好有鯉魚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不會有那種游泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 心情很好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就會知道比賽的分組了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是籃球部的比賽？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是最後一次大賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我超期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 回去時順便買點東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一不小心拼到決賽該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我該拼的時候可是很會拼的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可別又重新愛上我喲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神經病
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隨便你說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖說如此 我卻沒辦法放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能不能再期待一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目標是參加決賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們也太誇張了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的果然是候補啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過你還是會去加油的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去是會去的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？你會來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.01,0:12:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大賽的分組安排表
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很勁爆的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乾脆大賽那天把千春他們也叫來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起來加油增加氣勢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什…什…什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們第一回合的對手是去年的優勝隊 超勇猛的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要打進決賽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能了 不可能了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不妙 變成機器人了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了 已經完了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學居然是個膽小鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 正如MAITY說的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是害怕知道大谷的真實想法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 檸檬用蜂蜜醃就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去 這樣一直偽裝回到過去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼也不做 一定會後悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷怎麼想我都沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好慢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比賽要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:13:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你幹什麼啊 一大早就嚇唬人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 累成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我熬夜做了一些加油小道具
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油小道具？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從今天起 你們都是大谷啦啦隊的一分子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了 隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別這麼喪氣嘛 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也會坐在候補位置上為大家加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你就是隊長 大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一回合的對手是我們 請多多指教囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I…my…me…my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,you…you…are…you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 我們是大谷啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.58,0:15:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你們來了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 大谷人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他剛剛跟對手碰過面 受到不小的刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搖搖晃晃的不知道去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是馬上就要比賽了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 我去看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 我被強迫加入大谷啦啦隊了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 反正我是候補球員
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就幫大谷加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最愛中尾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硬要說的話 算是集中精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走啦 比賽要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼大谷啦啦隊 真丟人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪裡丟人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家特地來幫你加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 沒什麼油好加的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正輸定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弄得這麼聲勢浩大 輸的時候反而更丟人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這懦夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還沒比就輸輸輸的 本來會贏的都贏不了了 大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什麼辦法 碰到那種隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這樣 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不會給你這樣的傢伙加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以後我一輩子都叫你矮人國喪家犬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這什麼東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天整晚沒睡 睏得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫有男朋友的人做出這種背叛行為
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給你站住
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事沒事 我們去加油就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法 我不想看他比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種…那種毫無鬥志的矮人國喪家犬的比賽…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰是矮人國喪家犬？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先好好加油再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說了 我才不幫那種沒鬥志的人加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 我鬥志正旺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久沒挨你的笨蛋拳了 還蠻有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仔細看好 我保證你一定會迷上我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 隨便你說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼陣容啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.29,0:18:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經不僅僅是高大可以形容的了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是當然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷可是個該拼就會拼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 大谷好厲害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼高大的都被他甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這檸檬是用什麼醃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒釀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒釀？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為家裡剛好沒有蜂蜜了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.31,0:19:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好沒在比賽前吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家整晚沒睡 硬是撐著快合上的眼睛給你做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枉費你特地來幫我加油 我卻輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你很帥呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害我又迷上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是有你加油 也不會打出這麼好的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然你說過要放棄喜歡我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能沒有小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我好好聽啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎這個笨蛋 幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,預告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 你生日想要什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼可愛的戒指我都不想要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要的只有大谷的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是非賣品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛情結 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史上最棒的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看噢
